    <string-array name="sample_page_bullets">
        <item>Your name · your role</item>
        <item>Where I am from|What I do now|One thing people remember me for</item>
        <item>A project I am proud of|What I learned from it|The result in one number</item>
        <item>The problem I want to work on|Why it matters to me|Who I want to meet</item>
        <item>Thank you for listening|Ask me anything</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="sample_notes">
        <item>Smile, wait two seconds, look at the back rows. Say your name slowly, then your role in one short sentence.</item>
        <item>Where you grew up or studied. What you do day to day. One detail that makes you memorable, like a hobby or a habit.</item>
        <item>Tell one project as a tiny story: the problem, what you did, the result. Give one number people can repeat.</item>
        <item>Say what you want to work on next and why. Turn to the left and right side of the room on this page.</item>
        <item>Thank the audience. Pause. Look at the middle rows and invite a question.</item>
    </string-array>
